  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion, carrots, and celery and cook until the vegetables are softened.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the shrimp and cook until they are pink and fully cooked.",
    "Stir in the dried mint, lemon juice, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer the mixture for 2 minutes.",
    "Serve the gambas al ajillo hot, garnished with additional dried mint if desired."
